OL,3,GNEWSAPatient writes song to thank
OL,4,Ahospital stroke team
OL,5,
OL,6,FNormally, when you are discharged from
OL,7,Fhospital, you might thank the
OL,8,Fhardworking team with a box of biscuits
OL,9,For a card. But not Mike Tetley.
OL,11,FHe decided to write a song to show his
OL,12,Fappreciation for the staff who helped
OL,13,Fnurse him back to health after he was
OL,14,Fadmitted to the Acute Stroke Unit at
OL,15,Fthe Royal Berkshire Hospital.
OL,17,F"For a couple of days I didn't know
OL,18,Fwhether I was going to be here the next
OL,19,Fday," he said. "The care and compassion
OL,20,Fthat I got from everyone around me was
OL,21,Findescribable."
